{"sections":[{"slug":"同伦假设","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"同伦假设"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">同伦假设</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"同伦假设"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">陈述</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">存在</span> $(\\infty,1)$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴的等价</span>\n$$\r\n\\Pi\\colon \\mathsf {Top} \\to \\mathsf{Ani},\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">其中</span> $\\mathsf {Top}$ <span lang=\"zh\">是拓扑空间的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/模型范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">模型范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":", $\\Pi X$ <span lang=\"zh\">为拓扑空间</span> $X$ "},{"Local":{"url":"/数学对象的表现","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">表现</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/生象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">生象</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">也是</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">的奇异单纯集</span> $\\operatorname{Sing}X$ <span lang=\"zh\">表现的生象</span>.</p>\n"}]}}}]}